   },
   "text": "A deer, torn open. The crows have had its eyes.\nThey don't fly off when I come close."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11900,
    "z0": 7650,
    "x1": 14450,
    "z1": 9690
   },
   "text": "His clipboard. Wind speed, temperature, cloud, every hour since midnight.\nThe last line just stops.\nHis cap, his glasses. Feathers everywhere."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12070,
    "z0": 6460,
    "x1": 13770,
    "z1": 7650
   },
   "text": "An instrument screen. The door's open and the thermometer's smashed."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 14280,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 17680,
    "z1": 5780
   },
   "text": "Blood, a drop every step. Someone went north along the ridge, toward the mast."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 15470,
    "z0": 12240,
    "x1": 17170,
    "z1": 13260
   },
   "text": "SUMMIT 2104 M. WEATHER STATION. MAST, NO ENTRY."
  },
  {
